abstract: >-
  This repository contains the public reproducibility materials for the study
  'Auditable autonomous symbolic discovery of urban thermal relationships with
  admissibility constraints and separated validation'. It provides the frozen
  scientific code, public analysis-ready Shenzhen tables, protocol and
  provenance records, and a portable verification layer. Restricted Changchun
  row-level data and raw source products whose redistribution rights are not
  confirmed are not included in the public repository.
keywords:
  - urban climate
  - land surface temperature
  - symbolic regression
  - reproducibility
  - autonomous discovery
  - spatial validation
  - Shenzhen
